<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Amlac buys auto body parts business.</title>
<headline>Amlac buys auto body parts business.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amlac Ltd said on Wednesday it had bought the net assets and opeartions of Mr G Motor Body Parts with effect from April 1, 1997.</p>
<p>It gave no further details in the brief announcement but said these would be included in the annual financial statements for the year ended December 31 which are expected to be released at the beginning of March.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
